xt":"四季坂学园的二年级学生。散发着神秘气息的演剧部前辈。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"表情变化极少，让人完全琢磨不到她的心中所想。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"在吵吵嚷嚷的演剧部女生部员中是唯一一个比较稳重的，不过不可思议地是，她和其她人也混得很熟。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"最喜欢书本，唯独当谈及书的话题时话才比较多。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"16107"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/7b/7b48d4bd57ea2988536998fae152ca385adbaf7228cc2ed6f9f64a04311dcb71.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e9/e92781691f8daf963906c76f6e8c89a9d593005ab22df42f29d5ac06efe04524.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"大久保藍子","creatorId":"vndb:s361","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s361","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s361","name":"大久保 藍子","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:37788:16107:5075:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c26508","characterName":"大木 遥","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"16105","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"37788"}],"egsCharacterIds":["8823"],"vndbCharacterId":"c26508"},"originalCharacterName":"大木 遥","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"18"},"birthday":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"913"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"四季坂学園の３年生。由佳のクラスメイトで演劇部副部長。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"長身に端正な顔立ち、更には落ち着いた雰囲気で男性役等もこなすことから同性の後輩からよく慕われている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"外見のイメージからクールな印象を与えがちだが、実際は控え目で温厚な性格。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"また、外見に似合わず可愛いもの好きであったり、乙女チックなところがある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"由佳とは旧知の仲で、非常に仲が良い。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"8823","sourceWorkId":"16879","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"四季坂学园的三年级学生。由佳的同班同学，演剧部副部长。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"高挑的身材，端正的面容，加之气质沉稳，能够饰演男性角色。很受同性后辈的仰慕。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"从外表上容易给人一种很冷酷的印象，然而实则性格低调温厚。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"而且与其外表不相符地，她很喜欢可爱的东西，有些少女情调。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"和由佳是老相识了，关系很好。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"16105"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/85/851feb2bddf05daf3c706fc2f864f3d4df71dacb95e21d8417f0bf9b45ce6279.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/96/96efd4dff74d07ec9989c9946c8f88372db157dda548d3d03c92fadccb7a8dfe.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"小林眞紀","creatorId":"vndb:s279","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s279","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s279","name":"小林 眞紀","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:37788:16105:5906:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c26509","characterName":"野々村 真紀","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"16106","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"37788"}],"egsCharacterIds":["8824"],"vndbCharacterId":"c26509"},"originalCharacterName":"野々村 真紀","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"四季坂学園の１年生。いつも元気な大輔のクラスメイト。演劇部の新入部員。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"快活で人懐っこいムードメーカー的な存在で、思っていることがすぐに口に出てしまう素直な性格。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そんな性格からか、男女問わず友人が多い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかし、異性からは「お前は友達にしておきたいタイプ」と言われて全くと言っていいほどモテない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"部活紹介の時に男装していた遥に一目惚れして入部してきた為、先輩部員の中でも特別遥のことを慕っている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"8824","sourceWorkId":"16879","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"四季坂学园的一年级学生。演剧部的新部员。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"时时刻刻都精力充沛的大輔的同学。开朗又与人亲近，是个气氛制造者。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"性格直率，心里怎么想的嘴上便怎么说。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"或许是拜这种性格所赐，男女性朋友都很多。但是用异性的话说是「你是那种想把你作为好朋友的类型」，可以说是完全地“不受欢迎”。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"对社团介绍时身着男装的遥一见钟情，加入了演剧部，所以在前辈部员中尤为喜欢遥。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"16106"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d0/d09b53bb53cf30b641c78606a46a97b6b30b38857bb4881cd1eb7a6ed07611d1.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/06/061fa3c1f1959122974e57c0dead28a17ddc9261557c9fd1420972c32841d408.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"柚原みう","creatorId":"vndb:s977","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s977","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s977","name":"柚原 みう","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:37788:16106:15162:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c26510","characterName":"山吹 理央","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"16108","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"37788"}],"egsCharacterIds":["8826"],"vndbCharacterId":"c26510"},"originalCharacterName":"山吹 理央","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"四季坂学園１年生。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"新入生一の美少女とも言われる大輔のクラスメイト。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"演劇部の新入部員。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"淑やかな外見ながら、気さくな性格で男女問わず友達も多い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"特に同じ部活仲間の野々村真紀とはよく行動を共にしている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そんな彼女には校内で唯一、大輔だけが知らない秘密があるらしい。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"8826","sourceWorkId":"16879","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"四季坂学园的一年级学生。演剧部的新人。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"大輔的同班同学，号称新生中排位第一的美少女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"外表端庄性格直爽，男女性朋友都很多。尤其经常和社团好友野々村真紀一起行动。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"大輔似乎是校内唯一一个不知道她的秘密的人。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"16108"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{"sex":[{"comparisonValue":"m","source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c26510","value":"m"},{"comparisonValue":"f","source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"8826","value":"女性"},{"comparisonValue":"f","source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"8826","value":"女性"}]},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/25/25636dd4f6cc9f0c75e291cf5a1013250a8d9463c81e6fa744a66fdaef867cb4.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/3c/3cc8b1494be439b2fba588a859849109eb7b30a3c63f780ee38382cc7d077717.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"脇麻沙未","creatorId":"vndb:s18009","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s18009","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s18009","name":"脇 麻沙未","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:37788:16108:7881:1","source":"bangumi"},{"creditedName":"星岡 奏衣","creatorId":"vndb:s1401","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1401","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1401","name":"星岡 奏衣","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:45566","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_c26511","characterName":"藤原 麻美","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"16109","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"37788"}],"egsCharacterIds":["8827"],"vndbCharacterId":"c26511"},"originalCharacterName":"藤原 麻美","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"大輔たちのクラスの担任にして演劇部の幽霊顧問。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"およそ教師とは思えないようなセクシーな風貌で、男子生徒たちを惑わせる有り難い（迷惑？）存在。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"由佳の従姉、松沢奈々とは旧知の仲で、由佳のことも幼い頃か